1. Install Microsoft Visual Studio C++ 2022 Community Edition

2. Install CUDA (nvcc --version)
    a. make sure Nvidia driver is installed (nvidia-smi)
    b. once installed, make sure that the env variable CUDA_HOME exists and 		 	CUDA_PATH below

    																

3.Instal ffmpeg
	a. Download ffmpeg and save it somewhere in C:
	b. Add bin subfolder to windows path

4. Run git lfs version to check if it’s installed

5. Install VLC Media player.

6. Run env.

7. pip install setup tools

8. pip install matplotlib

9. pip install -e .
